sues/108).\n- Structured freeze: [#101 comment 3058](http://127.0.0.1:3001/recovery-admin/glantri-app/issues/101#issuecomment-3058); serial batch boundary: [comment 3059](http://127.0.0.1:3001/recovery-admin/glantri-app/issues/101#issuecomment-3059); prose acceptance: [comment 3214](http://127.0.0.1:3001/recovery-admin/glantri-app/issues/101#issuecomment-3214).\n- Prose source: `/Users/vidarhald/Documents/Glantri local/C1_Criticals_34_Reader_Prose_PO_Proposal.md`, Section A entries 01, 12, 13, 25, 27; verified SHA-256 `28d579d02419645b4d5b91b2b660c05710a2d1fee1b3397dafc918c93b27ea3c`.\n- Exact keys: `sharp|arm|01`, `blunt|head|10`, `blunt|chest|04`, `pointed_weapons|arm|09`, `pointed_weapons|arm|11`.\n\n### BUILDER RETURN\n\n- Dispatch: Glantri app — Forgejo / Builder / completed.\n- Thread ID: `01a09268-e0e2-7c90-93ec-b55728f9a8d9`.\n- Task: `codex://threads/01a09268-e0e2-7c90-93ec-b55728f9a8d9`.\n- Worktree: `/private/tmp/glantri-108-c1-builder`.\n- Exact baseline and direct parent: `33a85bdb949896a5f046554f0c00769a855314f3`.\n- Branch: `codex/108-c1-criticals-batch-1-wording`.\n- Immutable head: `a8bcfdb653dd37aa6d8a489c0f0f098ab545a7c4`.\n- State: READY FOR INDEPENDENT QA. Builder performed no independent QA and dispatched none. No merge.\n\n### Changes and preservation evidence\n\nThree files changed under `packages/rules-engine/src/encounters/`:\n\n- `representativeCriticalFixtures.ts`: exactly five titles and five narratives, matched character-for-character to the accepted source.\n- `representativeCriticalFixtures.test.ts`: updated the complete deterministic fixture export golden only after proving the permitted prose-only delta.\n- `representativeCriticalBatch1.test.ts`: 18 focused checks for exact prose in fixture/runtime exports, deterministic retained rolls and serialization, exact source ranges/identities, frozen mechanics, the 29 untouched fixtures, and five unchanged Integrated reviews.\n\nBefore editing, captured all 34 fixture objects, every runtime